{"id":"f4dcbc95-7de6-4a18-bfae-2cdb4458360b","createdAt":"2026-10-26T12:00:53.211Z","batchId":"login_glm-5-3-flash-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"glm-5.3-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\" style=\"max-width:420px\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:var(--space,24px)\">\n    <div class=\"center\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;background:var(--accent,#4f46e5);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:12px\">AC</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0\">Welcome back</h1>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:0\">Sign in to your Acme Cloud workspace to continue.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <form id=\"login-form\" class=\"stack gap\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:600\">Email address</span>\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required style=\"width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border,#d4d4d8);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit;outline:none\" />\n        </label>\n        <span class=\"small\" id=\"email-error\" style=\"color:var(--danger,#dc2626);display:none\">Please enter a valid email address.</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"between\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n          <span class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:600\">Password</span>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"small\" id=\"forgot-link\">Forgot password?</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"position:relative\">\n          <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"Enter your password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" required style=\"width:100%;padding:10px 44px 10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border,#d4d4d8);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit;outline:none\" />\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" id=\"toggle-pass\" aria-label=\"Show password\" style=\"position:absolute;right:4px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)\">Show</button>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"small\" id=\"password-error\" style=\"color:var(--danger,#dc2626);display:none\">Password must be at least 8 characters.</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <label class=\"check row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember\" name=\"remember\" checked />\n        <span class=\"small\">Remember me on this device for 30 days</span>\n      </label>\n\n      <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\" id=\"form-error\" style=\"display:none;margin:0\">\n        <span class=\"small\">Incorrect email or password. Please try again.</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block btn-lg\" id=\"submit-btn\">Sign in</button>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm center small muted\" style=\"margin-top:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center\">\n    <span>Don't have an account?</span>\n    <a href=\"#\">Contact your workspace admin</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm center small muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px;justify-content:center\">\n    <a href=\"#\">Privacy</a>\n    <span>·</span>\n    <a href=\"#\">Terms</a>\n    <span>·</span>\n    <a href=\"#\">Help</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var form = document.getElementById('login-form');\n  var email = document.getElementById('email');\n  var pass = document.getElementById('password');\n  var emailErr = document.getElementById('email-error');\n  var passErr = document.getElementById('password-error');\n  var formErr = document.getElementById('form-error');\n  var btn = document.getElementById('submit-btn');\n  var toggle = document.getElementById('toggle-pass');\n\n  toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    var showing = pass.type === 'text';\n    pass.type = showing ? 'password' : 'text';\n    toggle.textContent = showing ? 'Show' : 'Hide';\n    pass.focus();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('forgot-link').addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    formErr.style.display = 'none';\n    alert('If an account exists for that email, a reset link will be sent.');\n  });\n\n  function validEmail(v) {\n    return /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(v);\n  }\n\n  function validate() {\n    var ok = true;\n    var eOk = validEmail(email.value.trim());\n    emailErr.style.display = eOk ? 'none' : 'block';\n    email.style.borderColor = eOk ? '' : 'var(--danger,#dc2626)';\n    if (!eOk) ok = false;\n    var pOk = pass.value.length >= 8;\n    passErr.style.display = pOk ? 'none' : 'block';\n    pass.style.borderColor = pOk ? '' : 'var(--danger,#dc2626)';\n    if (!pOk) ok = false;\n    return ok;\n  }\n\n  email.addEventListener('input', function () {\n    if (validEmail(email.value.trim())) { emailErr.style.display = 'none'; email.style.borderColor = ''; }\n  });\n  pass.addEventListener('input', function () {\n    if (pass.value.length >= 8) { passErr.style.display = 'none'; pass.style.borderColor = ''; }\n  });\n\n  form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    formErr.style.display = 'none';\n    if (!validate()) return;\n    btn.disabled = true;\n    btn.textContent = 'Signing in…';\n    setTimeout(function () {\n      btn.disabled = false;\n      btn.textContent = 'Sign in';\n      formErr.style.display = 'block';\n    }, 1200);\n  });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[4308,"<div"],[4308," class"],[4308,"=\""],[4308,"page"],[4308,"\""],[4308," style"],[4308,"=\""],[4308,"max"],[4308,"-width"],[4308,":"],[4308,"420"],[4308,"px"],[5649,"\">\n"],[5661," "],[5661," <"],[5661,"div"],[5661," class"],[5661,"=\""],[5661,"stack"],[5661," gap"],[5661,"-lg"],[5661,"\""],[5661," style"],[5661,"=\""],[5661,"text"],[5661,"-align"],[5661,":center"],[5661,";margin"],[5661,"-bottom"],[5661,":"],[5661,"var"],[5661,"(--"],[5661,"space"],[5661,","],[5661,"24"],[5662,"px"],[5662,")\">\n"],[5662,"   "],[5662," <"],[5662,"div"],[5662," class"],[5662,"=\""],[5662,"center"],[5662,"\">\n"],[5662,"     "],[5662," <"],[5662,"div"],[5662," class"],[5662,"=\""],[5662,"avatar"],[5662,"\""],[5662," style"],[5662,"=\""],[5662,"width"],[5672,":"],[5672,"56"],[5672,"px"],[5672,";height"],[5672,":"],[5672,"56"],[5672,"px"],[5672,";font"],[5672,"-size"],[5672,":"],[5672,"20"],[5672,"px"],[5672,";font"],[5672,"-weight"],[5672,":"],[5672,"700"],[5672,";background"],[5672,":"],[5672,"var"],[5672,"(--"],[5672,"accent"],[5672,",#"],[5672,"4"],[5672,"f"],[5672,"46"],[5672,"e"],[5672,"5"],[5672,");"],[5672,"color"],[5672,":#"],[5672,"fff"],[5672,";display"],[5672,":flex"],[5683,";"],[5683,"align"],[5683,"-items"],[5683,":center"],[5683,";"],[5683,"justify"],[5683,"-content"],[6827,":center"],[6827,";border"],[6827,"-radius"],[6827,":"],[6827,"12"],[6827,"px"],[6827,"\">"],[6827,"AC"],[6827,"</div"],[6827,">\n"],[6827,"   "],[6827," </"],[6827,"div"],[6827,">\n"],[6827,"   "],[6827," <"],[6827,"div"],[6827," class"],[6827,"=\""],[6827,"stack"],[6827," gap"],[6827,"-sm"],[6827,"\">\n"],[6827,"     "],[6827," <"],[6827,"h"],[6827,"1"],[6827," style"],[6827,"=\""],